Z||000004||FieroSoul||10-19-2001||06:41 AM||||  Sounds like you found your problem.  Could be outputting on high all the time.  Chances are if you didn't change the regulator that it was the bad part.  I once was on a missile site where the generator switched on DC and AC at the same time and the lights all glowed like you describe before every power supply in the place burned up. I know that probably doesn't help but your description reminded me of it.  Good Luck.||||reg||6
